  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 700 STANDARDS OF DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION FOR SEWERAGE AND WASTEWATER TREATMENT FACILITIES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Wq 700 STANDARDS OF DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION FOR SEWERAGE AND WASTEWATER TREATMENT FACILITIES\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 485-A:6, III\n\nRevision Note:\n\nDocument #8590, effective 3-25-06, readopted with amendments and redesignated former Chapter Env-Ws 700 titled Standards of Design and Construction for Sewerage and Wastewater Treatment Facilities as Env-Wq 700 pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05.\n\nThe prior filings for former Env-Ws 700 include the following documents:\n\n#757, eff 2-18-76\n\n#2245, eff 12-31-82\n\n#2670, eff 4-12-84\n\n#4860, eff 7-5-90; EXPIRED 7-5-96\n\n#6350, INTERIM, eff 10-5-96, EXPIRED 2-2-97\n\n#6590, eff 9-26-97\n\n#8434, INTERIM, eff 9-26-05, EXPIRES: 3-25-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq700.html"
